   "“Say, Tom, let <em>me</em> whitewash a little.”",
   "Tom considered, was about to consent; but he altered his mind:",
   "“No—no—I reckon it wouldn’t hardly do, Ben. You see, Aunt Polly’s awful particular about this fence—right here on the street, you know—but if it was the back fence I wouldn’t mind and <em>she</em> wouldn’t. Yes, she’s awful particular about this fence; it’s got to be done very careful; I reckon there ain’t one boy in a thousand, maybe two thousand, that can do it the way it’s got to be done.”",
